Bugfix: Restore partially matching hard-linked files correctly

When restoring over an existing file that had multiple hard links and whose
data blobs only partly matched the snapshot, restic replaced the file by
an empty one but still skipped writing the blobs it believed were already
present. The restored file then contained zero bytes in place of those
blobs. Restic now rewrites the whole file in this case.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22085
